[-(4) whether the plan is in conflict with other provisions of this chapter; -]

[-(5)-][+ (4)+] whether the plan conflicts with other provisions of this chapter; and
[-(6)-][+ (5)+] the likely financial impacts of the conservation and efficient fuel-switching programs on the utility.
