BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF MINNESOTA:

ARTICLE 1
MISCELLANEOUS

Section 1.
Minnesota Statutes 2024, section 3.9215, subdivision 4, is amended to read:

Subd. 4.
Appropriation.
Money appropriated for the ombudsperson for American Indian families from the general fund or the special fund authorized by section 256.01, subdivision 2, paragraph (n), is under the control of the ombudsperson.

Sec. 2.
